<title>PHILIPPINES: PDCP 9-mth net up at 90.042 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>PDCP 9-mth net up at 90.042 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
